/*
 * FamilyDashBoard — intended HTTP response headers
 *
 * These headers are enforced by Cloudflare Pages, Netlify, and Vercel.
 * GitHub Pages (current deployment target) does NOT support custom headers.
 *
 * See ADR-018 for the full rationale.
 * See docs/security.md for the security model.
 *
 * To activate: deploy to Cloudflare Pages with this file in the output directory
 * (Vite `publicDir: 'src/public'` already copies public/ → dist/, so adding
 * this file to dist/ via a postbuild script would activate it on Cloudflare Pages).
 */

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-site
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: trusted-types dashboard; require-trusted-types-for 'script'
